# ignore big / derived stuff
# NOTE: git on Windows matches case-insensitively (core.ignorecase=true), so
# any pattern here that differs only in case from a real tracked folder will
# silently swallow it too. There is no "Scripts/" folder any more (consolidated
# into scripts/, which IS tracked) -- do not add a same-named-but-cased pattern.
Data/
Outputs/
Figures/
*.tif
*.tiff
*.zip
*.rds
*.rdata
*.csv
*.gpkg
*.geotiff
*.jp2
*.nc
.Rproj.user
.Rhistory
